+test("図面PDFの上限は、保存した値を表示し、変えるとサーバーへ保存して次の保存で使う。0 以下は受け付けない", async () => {
+  await withAiInput(
+    {
+      routes: {
+        "GET /api/export/config": { export_folder: "/tmp/export", default_select_count: 10, figure_pdf_max_mb: 8 },
+        "POST /api/export/config": (request) => ({ success: true, export_folder: "/tmp/export", ...(request.body as object) }),
+        "POST /api/export/ai-bundle/save": { success: true, markdown_name: "a.md", figure_pdf_names: ["a.pdf"], has_images: true },
+      },
+    },
+    async (app, page) => {
+      const modal = await generate(app, page);
+      const input = findBySelector<HTMLInputElement>(modal, "input.figure-pdf-max-mb-input");
+      assert.equal(input.value, "8");
+
+      await typeInto(input, "4.5");
+      assert.deepEqual(app.lastBody("POST /api/export/config"), { figure_pdf_max_mb: 4.5 });
+      await click(findByText(modal, ".ai-preview-modal-header button", "2ファイルを保存"));
+      assert.equal(app.lastBody("POST /api/export/ai-bundle/save").figure_pdf_max_mb, 4.5);
+
+      const posts = app.api.requestsTo("POST /api/export/config").length;
